#### E. Confidential Computing for Banking Governance

* **Tools:** **OpenAI Private Intelligence**[2].
* **Why It Matters:** Banks cannot expose core banking source code or vulnerability details to public cloud LLMs due to compliance and regulatory constraints. Private Intelligence uses confidential computing enclaves, ensuring models process sensitive proprietary code without data retention or vendor training[2].

